          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "फुर्तीला — phurtīlā — \"nimble; brisk\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "फुर्तीला खिलाड़ी गेंद को जल्दी पकड़ लेता है। phurtīlā khilāṛī gẽd ko jaldī pakaṛ letā hai. A nimble player catches the ball quickly."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "फुर्तीला (phurtīlā) is phurtī, \"briskness\", with the ending -īlā, \"full of\"; CDIAL lists Hindi phurtī, \"activity\", under Sanskrit sphuráti, \"darts, quivers\" (CDIAL 13849)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
